00:14:03.260 --> 00:14:05.380
But independent of that, I
believe this is just really one

00:14:05.380 --> 00:14:06.920
of the base things that you should do.

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:08.900
In my opinion, everybody should do this.

00:14:08.900 --> 00:14:11.330
It gives you clarity and
focus and also just helps you

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:13.230
